<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fall Undergraduate Research Expo</title>
</head>

<body style="
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    background-color:#f1f1f1;
    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color:#222222;
">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f1f1f1;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:15px;">

            <table width="700" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                   style="
                       width:700px;
                       max-width:100%;
                       background-color:#ffffff;
                   ">

                <!-- VIEW IN BROWSER -->
                <tr>
                    <td align="center"
                        style="
                            padding:25px 20px 10px;
                            font-size:11px;
                            color:#999999;
                        ">
                        View in browser
                    </td>
                </tr>


                <!-- HEADER LOGO -->
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding:20px 30px 25px;">

                        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                            <tr>

                                <td style="padding-right:16px;">
                                    <img
                                        src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sjacksom3/gophishingtech41/main/images/purdue-email-logo.png"
                                        alt="Purdue University"
                                        width="245"
                                        style="
                                            display:block;
                                            max-width:245px;
                                            height:auto;
                                            border:0;
                                        "
                                    >
                                </td>

                                <td
                                    style="
                                        border-left:1px solid #aaaaaa;
                                        padding-left:16px;
                                        font-size:13px;
                                        font-weight:bold;
                                        color:#333333;
                                        white-space:nowrap;
                                    ">
                                    Office of Undergraduate Research
                                </td>

                            </tr>
                        </table>

                    </td>
                </tr>


                <!-- BODY -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="
                        padding:0 24px 20px;
                        font-size:16px;
                        line-height:1.35;
                        color:#111111;
                        font-family:'Source Serif Pro', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
                    ">

                        <h2 style="
                            margin:0 0 24px;
                            font-size:20px;
                            line-height:1.3;
                            font-weight:bold;
                            color:#111111;
                        ">
                            Invitation to Judge the Fall Undergraduate Research Expo
                        </h2>


                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            Dear Mr. {{.LastName}},
                        </p>


                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            The Office of Undergraduate Research invites you to serve as a judge for the upcoming 
                            Fall Undergraduate Research Expo. Your participation in the judging panel plays an 
                            instrumental role in supporting undergraduate students as they present their research 
                            and creative work. 
                        </p>


                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            The judging portion of the Fall Undergraduate Research Expo takes place on November 
                            17th and November 19th and is located at the Purdue Memorial Union Ballrooms 
                            and the Stewart Center on the Purdue University campus in West Lafayette, Indiana.  
                        </p>


                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            Judges provide valuable feedback to undergraduate student presenters about the 
                            quality and status of their research. No specialized knowledge of a student’s specific 
                            research discipline is required; presenters are expected to communicate their work to 
                            a generally educated audience.  
                        </p>


                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            As a member of the judging panel, you will be asked to evaluate how effectively 
                            presenters communicate their research, as well as provide pieces of constructive 
                            feedback based on the established judging expectations and standards. A baseline 
                            guide will be provided to all judges which will highlight the expectations and 
                            standards.  
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            We understand that your time is valuable. For this reason, we are offering a $500 
                            stipend to cover any travel costs. As a judge, you may be eligible for a complimentary 
                            hotel stay on the date you have selected to participate.    
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            If you are interested in participating in the 2026 Fall Undergraduate Research Expo as a 
                            member of the judging panel, please review the signup information and indicate your 
                            preferred availability using the link below.    
                        </p>


                        <!-- CTA -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                               style="margin:25px 0;">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center">

                                    <a
                                        href="{{.URL}}"
                                        style="
                                            display:inline-block;
                                            background-color:#cfb991;
                                            color:#000000;
                                            text-decoration:none;
                                            font-size:14px;
                                            font-weight:bold;
                                            letter-spacing:0.5px;
                                            padding:14px 28px;
                                            border:1px solid #b9a47f;
                                        "
                                    >
                                        VIEW JUDGING INFORMATION
                                    </a>

                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>


                        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                            We appreciate your consideration and your support of
                            undergraduate research at Purdue University.
                        </p>


                        <p style="margin:0 0 5px;">
                            Sincerely,
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin:0 0 25px;">
                            <strong>Office of Undergraduate Research</strong><br>
                            Purdue University
                        </p>

                    </td>
                </tr>


                <!-- DIVIDER -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding:0 12px;">
                        <div style="
                            border-top:2px solid #8e6f3e;
                            font-size:1px;
                            line-height:1px;
                        ">
                            &nbsp;
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>


                <!-- FOOTER -->
                <tr>
                    <td align="center"
                        style="
                            padding:20px 25px 10px;
                            font-size:12px;
                            line-height:1.5;
                            color:#444444;
                        ">

                        Purdue University • 610 Purdue Mall •
                        West Lafayette, IN 47907

                    </td>
                </tr>


                <tr>
                    <td align="center"
                        style="
                            padding:5px 25px;
                            font-size:12px;
                            line-height:1.6;
                            color:#333333;
                        ">

                        <span style="text-decoration:underline;">Shop</span>
                        &nbsp;|&nbsp;

                        <span style="text-decoration:underline;">Visit</span>
                        &nbsp;|&nbsp;

                        <span style="text-decoration:underline;">Give</span>

                        <br>

                        <span style="text-decoration:underline;">
                            Manage Subscriptions
                        </span>
                        &nbsp;|&nbsp;

                        <span style="text-decoration:underline;">
                            Privacy Policy
                        </span>

                    </td>
                </tr>


                <tr>
                    <td align="center"
                        style="
                            padding:25px 25px 8px;
                            font-size:11px;
                            line-height:1.5;
                            color:#555555;
                        ">

                        This email was sent by:
                        <strong>Office of Undergraduate Research</strong>

                        <br>

                        Purdue University, West Lafayette, IN 47907, USA

                    </td>
                </tr>


                <!-- LOWER LOGO -->
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding:10px 20px 25px;">

                        <img
                            src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sjacksom3/gophishingtech41/main/images/purdue-email-logo.png"
                            alt="Purdue University"
                            width="190"
                            style="
                                display:block;
                                width:190px;
                                max-width:100%;
                                height:auto;
                                border:0;
                            "
                        >

                    </td>
                </tr>

            </table>

        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
